Tau Ceti Explorer

This project presents an interactive snapshot of mathematical roadmap material
from the Tau Ceti project and the revised modern number theory campaign.

TauCetiRoadmap and its contributors
Source: https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCetiRoadmap
The Apache License 2.0 in LICENSE is copied from that source repository.
Source documents have been reorganized for exploration, embedded in the atlas,
and sanitized to remove local filesystem paths. Recorded source hashes, commit
references, and report dates remain in the data. Progress summaries and local
user overrides are explorer features and do not modify the source reports.

